.env
# Local cargo config dir; the cargo-audit advisory ignore list is tracked
# because both CI workflows run `cargo audit` and must share it.
.cargo/*
!.cargo/audit.toml

# NOTE: Cargo.lock is committed to support security audits and reproducible builds
# across multiple developers and CI environments for this multi-platform binary.

# ─── GitForge runtime state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Smoke tests and compose runs seed bare repositories and pipeline workspaces
# relative to the repo root; they are runtime data, never source.
repos/
workspaces/
